cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this pipeline, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SISBEN IV — ETL Pipeline & Power BI Semantic Model"
abstract: >-
  End-to-end pipeline that ingests, cleans, validates and models SISBEN IV microdata for the
  125 municipalities of Antioquia, Colombia, and serves the results through a Power BI tabular
  model defined as code (TMDL). At full scale it processed about 25 million records across six
  annual snapshots (2021–2026). This public version contains no microdata; the sample in
  data/sample/ is synthetic.
